SUMMARY:energIA 2026 — IA & décarbonation
LOCATION:L’iceBergues\, Geneva
DESCRIPTION:Second edition of the Geneva conference on AI and the energy tr
 ansition\, debating whether AI genuinely helps reach net zero by 2050 or m
 ostly adds resource consumption and rebound effects\, with public\, privat
 e and academic participants and the Energ-IACK hackathon projects presenti
 ng their results.\n\nOrganiser: Energ-IA Transition with MCI\n\nDetails an
 d registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/energia-conference-genev
 a-2026/
URL:https://swissdataevents.ch/events/energia-conference-geneva-2026/
SEQUENCE:0
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
