DTSTAMP:20261128T140412Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261210T120000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Zurich:20261210T140000
SUMMARY:Rencontre avec Anne Hiltpold — IA & éducation : former aujourd
 ’hui les compétences de demain
LOCATION:CCIG\, Boulevard du Théâtre 4\, Geneva
DESCRIPTION:Lunch meeting at the Geneva chamber of commerce where Anne Hilt
 pold\, president of the Geneva Council of State\, presents survey results 
 on how Geneva students already use AI\, followed by a discussion with busi
 nesses on what it changes for skills\, jobs and training.\n\nOrganiser: CC
 IG — Chambre de commerce\, d’industrie et des services de Genève\n\nD
 etails and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/ccig-ia-educati
 on-competences-geneva-2026/
